+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2025, Google LLC.
+ * Pasha Tatashin <pasha.tatashin@soleen.com>
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 Amazon.com Inc. or its affiliates.
+ * Pratyush Yadav <ptyadav@amazon.de>
